===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[nervous]] [[system]]}}

# {{neuroanatomy}} The system which coordinates the activity of the muscles, monitors the organs, constructs and processes input from the senses, and initiates actions. In [[vertebrate]]s it consists of the [[brain]], the [[brainstem]], the [[spinal cord]], [[nerve]]s, and [[ganglion|ganglia]].

====Synonyms====
* [[systema nervosum]]

====Derived terms====
* [[autonomic nervous system]]
* [[central nervous system]]
* [[peripheral nervous system]]

